  "title": "Goi Ga (Vietnamese Chicken and Cabbage Salad)",
  "description": "Crisp, fresh, and delicious! The key to a good plate of Vietnamese goi ga salad is tossing the shredded chicken in a balance of dressing and fresh vegetables and herbs.",
